When automating these ACs, the word count is taken from the CLI's stdout (`viewer summary --view <brief|overview|preview> <document>`) as whitespace-delimited tokens, per architecture.yaml. If the Product Owner wants an exact counting rule stated in the story itself, raise it at refinement — the current wording deliberately mirrors the documented threshold without adding unstated rules.

